{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For more details about the demo, please refer to the demo page.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/d384339b96d41eb3010955887948e952.poster.avif?t=1770967053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/d384339b96d41eb3010955887948e952.webm?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/d384339b96d41eb3010955887948e952.mp4?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cThe best way to clean? Kill the mess at its source.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cleaner, commissioned by the Kim Demon before her vacation, sucks up everything that gets in the way of cleaning in this <strong>2D pixel roguelite shooting</strong> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/6ba3d2e6b21848ef1cb03a172b1093df.poster.avif?t=1770967053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/6ba3d2e6b21848ef1cb03a172b1093df.webm?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/6ba3d2e6b21848ef1cb03a172b1093df.mp4?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A\u2026 dungeon\u2026?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry! Dungeons aren\u2019t scary lairs anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019re fully licensed businesses, operating legally under proper regulations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeon Cleaning\u2026?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there was Kim Demon, weary from endless work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alas! The dungeon\u2019s seasonal inspection had fallen on the very same days as her seaside holiday with her fellow villains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fluster, she rummaged through her chamber\u2026 and there it was : <strong>A</strong> <strong>leaflet for a cleaning service.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so the question remains\u2014will everything turn out all right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/71f728730eb149a50200b1b516dd9b6d.poster.avif?t=1770967053\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/71f728730eb149a50200b1b516dd9b6d.webm?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/71f728730eb149a50200b1b516dd9b6d.mp4?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mighty Vacuum!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cleaner\u2019s most trusted companion is none other than <strong><i>\u201cB.F.V (Best Friend Vacuum)\u201d</i></strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small objects and enemy projectiles can be <strong>sucked up and turned into ammo</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigger objects</strong> may clog the vacuum head, but can still be <strong>launched back out</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The B.F.V isn\u2019t just a cleaning tool \u2014 it\u2019s a <i>shield, a weapon, a tool, and a strategy all in one</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>(But beware: not everything can be absorbed.)</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/b58f7d19ae38d98e5f2264283d3b6fa9.poster.avif?t=1770967053\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/b58f7d19ae38d98e5f2264283d3b6fa9.webm?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/b58f7d19ae38d98e5f2264283d3b6fa9.mp4?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don\u2019t be fooled by the cute(pixel)look!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019re all just filthy things waiting for you to clean up!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, the process will be a <strong>chaotic mess</strong>\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as long as it\u2019s clean in the end, isn\u2019t that what matters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/45cf52be021e3b5aaa9354f27263e7b8.poster.avif?t=1770967053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/45cf52be021e3b5aaa9354f27263e7b8.webm?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/45cf52be021e3b5aaa9354f27263e7b8.mp4?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In this world nothing can be said to be certain, except death and taxes, cleaning.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes\u2014quite literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you fall, the dungeon reshapes itself, offering a new run, a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, death isn\u2019t the end\u2026 it\u2019s the start of another round of cleaning.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Strangers(or NPCs) in a Dungeon?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything in the dungeon is out to get in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, you\u2019ll meet those who lend a hand with your cleaning!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some NPCs, once rescued, will move into the lobby, <strong>offering stat boosts or starting funcs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others appear as one-off events, <strong>giving you unexpected aid</strong> in a tight spot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But whether that hand is <strong>a lifeline\u2026 or a landmine, you\u2019ll only find out by taking it</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Two Cleaners Clean Alike.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is full of weapons and vacuum upgrades waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>melee, pistols, rifles, snipers, shotguns, and explosives</strong>\u2014 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to everything from simple stat boosts to wild, <strong>unexpected special effects</strong>\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your own unique way to clean!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3177800?t=1770967053","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3177800?t=1770967053","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/7be0002d14f2c83c64e6d008d961aa03fcac2ec6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770967053","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/7be0002d14f2c83c64e6d008d961aa03fcac2ec6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770967053","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4039530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For more details about the demo, please refer to the demo page.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/d384339b96d41eb3010955887948e952.poster.avif?t=1770967053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/d384339b96d41eb3010955887948e952.webm?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177800/extras/d384339b96d41eb3010955887948e952.mp4?t=1770967053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cThe best way to clean? Kill the mess at its source.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cleaner, commissioned by the Kim Demon before her vacation, sucks up everything that gets in the way of cleaning in this <strong>2D pixel roguelite shooting</strong> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play